From ad4e0660fbaaef1e1037e99ed4b3d2c642179951 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: meka3 <dosreishugo.etu@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 20:38:20 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Dashboard: clean shutdown, auto-rediscovery, popup-free
 pairing agent

- main.c: handle SIGINT/SIGTERM and SDL quit/Esc ourselves (SDL was
  swallowing Ctrl+C and the patched LVGL driver no longer exits), join
  worker threads with timeout, restore screen on exit.
- main.c: rediscover BlueZ MediaPlayer1 and oFono HFP modem
  periodically instead of once at startup (no restart needed after the
  first pairing or a disconnect).
- main.c: per-thread private D-Bus connections, 3 s timeouts, no D-Bus
  or network call under the shared lock or in the UI thread; buttons
  post commands to worker threads; cover reloaded only when it changes.
- bt_agent.c: BlueZ default Agent1 that auto-accepts pairing during the
  Pair window and trusts/connects the phone, so the Pi OS desktop popup
  no longer appears. Replaces bt_pairing.h + bt_make_discoverable.sh.
- album_art.c: curl timeouts/NOSIGNAL, atomic write of cover.jpg.
- SETUP.sh: valid BlueZ 5 main.conf keys, bluetooth/dialout groups.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011mQKZ4xqeG7ECaGPiWRhWe
